Usage:
  wpctl [OPTION…] COMMAND [COMMAND_OPTIONS] - WirePlumber Control CLI

Command: settings [KEY] [VAL]
  Shows, changes or removes settings

Help Options:
  -h, --help       Show help options

Application Options:
  -d, --delete     Deletes the saved setting value (no KEY means 'all')
  -s, --save       Saves the setting value (no KEY means 'all', no VAL means current value)
  -r, --reset      Resets the saved setting to its default value

